https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99904.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-30T15:08:06Z"},"body":"In single window mode, the dock will instead be docked and not floating.\r\n\r\nTo reproduce:\r\n1. In multi-window mode, save a layout with a floating dock.\r\n2. Change to single window mode.\r\n3. Load that layout.\r\n\r\nIt causes the UI to be messed up:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a7a7f43-dddb-416e-bcec-1310e89fcadd)\r\n\r\nIt also prints errors like: `editor/window_wrapper.cpp:222 - Condition \"!is_window_available()\" is true.`\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso fixes `restore_windows_on_load` preventing loading floating docks in a layout when false.\r\nThis setting should only affect the behavior when the editor is opened, and should not prevent floating windows when loading a layout (in multi-window mode).\r\nTo reproduce, disable the setting and load a layout with a floating dock.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99904/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"conf